      "authors": [
        "x1zzdev"
      ],
      "why_read": "Understand how a Rust-based domain-specific language can unify data pipelines, deep-learning compilation, and compile-time security guardrails. You will learn how zero-copy Arrow-to-Burn tensor transitions and static verification improve performance and auditing in production ML.",
